{"unit_id":"tag:0731:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环拓扑斯（ringed topos）。全无上同调（totally acyclic）层（sheaf）对于以下函子（functors）是右无上同调的（right acyclic）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 函子（functor）<MATH_0002>，对于任意对象（object）<MATH_0003> 在 <MATH_0004> 中；\n<STRUCT_0003> 函子（functor）<MATH_0005>，对于任意预层（presheaf），其取值为集合（sets），记为 <MATH_0006>；\n<STRUCT_0004> 全局截面（global sections）的函子（functor）<MATH_0007>；\n<STRUCT_0005> 函子（functor）<MATH_0008>，对于任意态射（morphism）<MATH_0009>，在赋环拓扑斯（ringed topoi）之间。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed topos","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"totally acyclic","target_term":"全无上同调"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"right acyclic","target_term":"右无上同调的"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"global sections","target_term":"全局截面"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed topos","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯","context":"底层拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"totally acyclic","target_term":"全无上同调","context":"层的全无上同调性"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"系数层"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子","context":"右无上同调性列表"},{"source_term":"right acyclic","target_term":"右无上同调的","context":"右导出函子消失"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"取截面或推前"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"取截面对象"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层","context":"广义取截面对象"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"预层取值"},{"source_term":"global sections","target_term":"全局截面","context":"全局截面函子"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","con