{"unit_id":"tag:0731:proof","translation":"第 (2) 项是全无上同调（totally acyclic）层（sheaf）的定义。第 (1) 项是 (2) 的推论，如全无上同调（totally acyclic）层（sheaves）定义后的讨论所指出。第 (3) 项是 (2) 的特殊情形，其中 <MATH_0001> 是 <MATH_0002> 的终对象（final object）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n为证明 (4)，由《位点上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理 <REF_0001>，可以假设 <MATH_0003> 由位点（sites）的态射（morphism）给出。此时，由引理 <REF_0002> 中对于高阶直接像（direct images）的描述，可知 <MATH_0004>、<MATH_0005> 对全无上同调（totally acyclic）层（sheaf）为零。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"totally acyclic","target_term":"全无上同调"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"totally acyclic","target_term":"全无上同调"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"final object","target_term":"终对象"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"direct images","target_term":"直接像"},{"source_term":"totally acyclic","target_term":"全无上同调"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"totally acyclic","target_term":"全无上同调","context":"层的全无上同调性"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"系数层"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"定义中的层"},{"source_term":"final object","target_term":"终对象","context":"全局截面对象"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模","context":"章节引用"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"态射表示"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"推前态射"},{"source_term":"direct images","target_term":"直接像","context":"高阶直接像描述"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08J6:statement","translation":"由上述结果可知，《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》引理 <REF_0001> 适用于多种情形。例如，给定态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>，在赋环拓扑斯（ringed topoi）之间，有 <MATH_0002>，对于任意 <MATH_0003>-模（modules）的层（sheaf）<MATH_0004> 都成立。具体地，对于内射（injective）的 <MATH_0005>-模（module）<MATH_0006>，<MATH_0007>-模（module）<MATH_0008> 是全无上同调的（totally acyclic），由引理 <REF_0002> 得到；而全无上同调（totally acyclic）层（sheaf）对于 <MATH_0009> 是无上同调的（acyclic），由引理 <REF_0003> 得到。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"totally acyclic","target_term":"全无上同调的"},{"source_term":"totally acyclic","target_term":"全无上同调"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"acyclic","target_term":"无上同调的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴","context":"章节引用"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"推前态射"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯","context":"态射的源与靶"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"系数模"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"系数层"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射","context":"内射模"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"结构层上的模"},{"source_term":"totally acyclic","target_term":"全无上同调的","context":"内射模的推前"},{"source_term":"totally acyclic","target_term":"全无上同调","context":"层的全无上同调性"},{"source_term":"acyclic","target_term":"无上同调的","context":"推前无上同调性"}],"notes":[]}
